SUMMARY:Collectors' Circle: Fall Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this season’s Collectors’ Circle gathering at the Museum featuring an exclusive meet-and-greet with Artist Lesley Dill\, featured in the current exhibition\, The Art of Paper. \nCollectors’ Circle Members have this opportunity to connect Dill before her In Conversation: Artist Talk at 6pm. \n  \n*Please note: this event is for current Collectors’ Circle Members. Learn more and become a Collectors’ Circle Member!
